  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>m</mi></math> be the minimum possible value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> , where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> are real numbers for which <math><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></math>. Let <math><mi>M</mi></math> be the maximum possible value of <math><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext>log</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext>log</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> are positive real numbers for which <math><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></math>. Then the value of <math><mrow><msub><mrow><mtext>log</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext>log</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Applying A.M-G.M inequality,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>81</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>27</mn></math>&nbsp;(applying A.M-G.M inequality)</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>27</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math></p><p>Thus, <math><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></math></p>",
